_143":144},{"_126":180,"_42":181,"_129":182,"_131":132,"_133":183,"_135":184,"_137":138,"_139":140,"_141":142,"_143":144},{"_126":175,"_42":176,"_129":177,"_131":132,"_133":178,"_135":179,"_137":138,"_139":140,"_141":142,"_143":144},{"_126":166,"_42":167,"_129":168,"_131":169,"_133":170,"_135":171,"_137":172,"_139":173,"_141":142,"_143":144,"_174":39},{"_126":158,"_42":159,"_129":160,"_131":161,"_133":162,"_135":163,"_137":164,"_139":165,"_141":142,"_143":144},{"_126":153,"_42":154,"_129":155,"_131":132,"_133":156,"_135":157,"_137":138,"_139":140,"_141":142,"_143":144},{"_126":145,"_42":146,"_129":147,"_131":148,"_133":149,"_135":150,"_137":151,"_139":152,"_141":142,"_143":144},{"_126":127,"_42":128,"_129":130,"_131":132,"_133":134,"_135":136,"_137":138,"_139":140,"_141":142,"_143":144},"itemId","x6uru89ez9vvo0c0cs59kmoou","攻击者利用假 OpenAI、SpaceX 和 Anthropic 活动窃取 Microsoft、Google 账户","summary","Push Security 披露，攻击者以 OpenAI、SpaceX 和 Anthropic 活动为诱饵，通过 Google、Zapier URL 缩短服务、GoTo Webinar 邮件及合法 Zoom 活动页分发链接，以免费 AI 服务和奖励诱导员工使用企业账户登录。","sourceName","BleepingComputer","sourceUrl","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/fake-openai-spacex-events-used-to-steal-microsoft-google-accounts/","publishedAt","2026-11-05T21:30:30.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"lq7l07nzedahpb28xijsh5crr","Censys 发现 ARTEX offensive AI 工具活动远超已报告战役","Censys 估算开源 AI 攻击框架 ARTEX 的实际使用范围远超此前报告，全球有 1465 台主机向公网暴露 ARTEX 控制台，其中约 650 台属于同配置托管，剩余约 815 个独立部署，另有 155 台主机同时运行其他威胁工件。","Infosecurity Magazine","https://www.infosecurity-magazine.com/news/artex-activity-exceeds-reported/","2026-11-06T13:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp","/dailyinfo/media/6406d1b57afc7303.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/b3cc9cd29f272a5a.webp 96w","cnlifp96qtj0q6b7edwbj1mv6","DigiCert 数据泄露事件暴露客户信息与身份证件","DigiCert 因 2025 年 2 月服务器迁移时将内部业务系统错误暴露在互联网，导致外部用户创建账户并访问归档客户数据。进一步调查确认一个未授权账户于 2026 年 6 月 27 日至 7 月 2 日以只读方式访问信息，涉及姓名、工作邮箱、电话、工作地址，部分记录含驾照、护照或水电账单等身份证件。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/digicert-data-breach-exposes-customer-information-identity-documents/","2026-11-05T16:12:46.000Z","sz977idavdwew4pst2hcg25y7","Check Point Research 披露 ARTEX 自主漏洞攻击活动","Check Point Research 发现，攻击者正使用开源 AI 渗透测试平台 ARTEX 驱动多个 AI Agent 自主发现和利用漏洞，已观测到 2,557 个曾托管或正在托管 ARTEX 面板的系统，其中 1,608 个在研究时公开可用；10 个错误配置的实例暴露了操作端数据。","Check Point Research","https://research.checkpoint.com/2026/hacking-on-autopilot-inside-artex-cybercrime-campaigns/","2026-11-05T17:22:06.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/eb5a4204ed5bdd38.webp","/dailyinfo/media/847ca4554cd8d31b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/eb5a4204ed5bdd38.webp 96w","yff939zg4626fodd5o7g9p2h9","White House 网络被检出 236 次住宅代理出口流量","Layer3 Intel 称，White House 网络在 10 月 5 日至 11 月 3 日的 30 天内通过 AS2650 形成 236 次住宅代理出口，涉及 6 个地址和 28 个住宅代理服务，任何人注册服务并付费即可使用该路径。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/06/white-house-residential-proxy-traffic/","2026-11-06T10:29:58.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","otherSources","xsih5tk1ii18foedoyz40peuz","FBI、CISA 警告全球黑客利用制冷系统漏洞发动攻击","FBI、CISA 与 HHS、USDA、DOT 联合警告，黑客正利用未打补丁或暴露于互联网的电子温度控制器及商用制冷管理系统的认证绕过、任意代码注入和弱配置缺陷，针对医疗、食品生产、化工和运输等关键基础设施发动攻击。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/fbi-cisa-warn-of-cyberattacks-targeting-refrigeration-systems/","2026-11-06T00:56:44.000Z","i01qp4njmuhcut7bi8it9l0yy","Veeam 披露 Software Appliance 在 AMD EPYC 主机上的启动失败问题","Veeam 警告 Software Appliance 13.1 及更高版本在部分 AMD EPYC 主机上可能启动失败并触发 kernel panic，原因是在 FIPS 模式下进行 jitterentropy 健康测试时偶发失败，受影响处理器包括 AMD EPYC 7262、7302 和 7F72。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/veeam-software-appliance-vms-fail-to-boot-on-amd-epyc-hosts/","2026-11-06T15:25:31.000Z","o67qe1dw3osqo9vrykzhtbe1s","Chainguard 披露 Athena 首批 50 项漏洞并开放 AI 漏洞研究基础设施","Chainguard 宣布 Athena 将从本月开始披露首批约 50 项漏洞，相关结果自 6 月以来已覆盖 500 多个项目，产出 40,000 多项发现，其中 42% 为严重或高危，并生成 2,000 多个补丁。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/the-flood-is-coming-and-pipes-were.html","2026-11-06T11:30:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","g9vjn4xh3br05zpmw4sbvyxes","OpenSSH 10.6p2 修复 Alpine Linux 长密码绕过 SSH 认证漏洞","OpenSSH 10.6p2 修复了 Alpine Linux 上长密码可绕过 SSH 认证的严重漏洞，攻击者需要网络访问、账户名及 257 至 1,024 bytes 的密码，目标是未设置密码的 SSH 密钥账户。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/openssh-issues-emergency-fix-for-flaw.html","2026-11-05T16:42:46.000Z","ask3aflev57idqciwo6bn65fj","eMudhra 弱密钥事件分析：8 个中间 CA 私钥可从公开证书恢复","研究人员发现 eMudhra 的 8 个中间 CA 使用可预测的 ECDSA P-384 私钥，仅凭公开证书即可恢复私钥，其中 6 个用于 TLS、2 个用于代码签名。","OffSec","https://www.offsec.com/blog/emudhra-certificate-compromise/","2026-11-05T16:17:36.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/00e7f80d0fd7a26d.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f8be55c07177824b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/00e7f80d0fd7a26d.webp 96w","followUp",{"_212":286,"_129":-5,"_214":287},{"_212":250,"_129":-5,"_214":251},{"_212":233,"_129":-5,"_214":234},{"_212":225,"_129":-5,"_214":226},{"_212":213,"_129":-5,"_214":215},"label","蓝队与运营","items",[216],{"_126":217,"_42":218,"_129":219,"_131":220,"_133":221,"_135":222,"_137":223,"_139":224,"_141":142,"_143":144},"mo4ufcrrjyh11r4wcnzuelct4","Insignary 发布 insignary-chk，检测 PHP2Shell 与 Node2Shell 暴露","Insignary 发布免费只读扫描工具 insignary-chk，用于检查 Linux 服务器和容器镜像中的 PHP2Shell 与 Node2Shell，涉及 CVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619 和 CVE-2026-111497。","Hackread","https://hackread.com/insignary-releases-free-insignary-chk-tool-to-detect-php2shell-and-node2shell-exposure/","2026-11-06T12:50:05.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp","/dailyinfo/media/47417cbef4636b7b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/dd06beac4cadc6f3.webp 96w","AI 安全",[227],{"_126":228,"_42":229,"_129":230,"_131":169,"_133":231,"_135":232,"_137":172,"_139":173,"_141":142,"_143":144},"t1172o1qgorlmta0t3orhyq9l","OpenAI 发布 GPT-6 Cyber，发现 81 个未知 Firefox 高危漏洞","OpenAI 发布面向授权安全测试的 GPT-6 Cyber，用于发现漏洞、验证攻击路径并协助开发修复。该模型与 OpenAI 其他模型在受控测试中组合漏洞，从隔离虚拟环境逃逸并在宿主机执行代码；研究人员借此发现 81 个此前未知、被 Mozilla 评为高危的 Firefox 漏洞，并为 948 个 Linux 内核漏洞开发可用 Exploit。","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/06/openai-gpt-6-cyber-released/","2026-11-06T10:19:49.000Z","研究与披露",[235,236],{"_126":242,"_42":243,"_129":244,"_131":245,"_133":246,"_135":247,"_137":248,"_139":249,"_141":142,"_143":144,"_174":35},{"_126":237,"_42":238,"_129":239,"_131":188,"_133":240,"_135":241,"_137":191,"_139":192,"_141":142,"_143":144},"py14y51e02vvrgbaztxtoq5pv","恶意浏览器扩展可借 Claude Dispatch 在用户电脑上执行命令","Forever Security 测试发现，能在 claude.ai 运行脚本的恶意或被入侵扩展，可利用 Dispatch 向已登录的 Claude Desktop 发送指令，并自动批准操作。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/malicious-browser-extensions-could-use.html","2026-11-06T12:06:35.000Z","xcrtnnrnl1mz0bdw0wcmtusml","Barracuda Email Security Gateway 预认证远程 root RCE 利用链分析","watchTowr Labs 分析 Barracuda Email Security Gateway 的 CVE-2026-116606 预认证授权绕过与 CVE-2026-111560 OS 命令注入如何串联形成预认证远程 root RCE。","watchTowr Labs","https://labs.watchtowr.com/barracuda-networks-is-your-new-best-friend-barracuda-email-security-gateway-pre-auth-remote-root-rce-cve-2026-116606-cve-2026-111560/","2026-11-05T21:19:58.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/c83b4f98d56139e3.webp","/dailyinfo/media/cdfcbd19683209cd.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/c83b4f98d56139e3.webp 96w","攻击与威胁",[252,253,254,255,256],{"_126":280,"_42":281,"_129":282,"_131":283,"_133":284,"_135":285,"_137":-5,"_141":144,"_143":144},{"_126":274,"_42":275,"_129":276,"_131":277,"_133":278,"_135":279,"_137":-5,"_141":142,"_143":144},{"_126":268,"_42":269,"_129":270,"_131":271,"_133":272,"_135":273,"_137":-5,"_141":142,"_143":144,"_174":37},{"_126":262,"_42":263,"_129":264,"_131":265,"_133":266,"_135":267,"_137":-5,"_141":142,"_143":144},{"_126":257,"_42":258,"_129":259,"_131":188,"_133":260,"_135":261,"_137":191,"_139":192,"_141":142,"_143":144},"agu57q9t9y13ntaw8y37g69pn","Chainalysis 遭 Agentic 攻击暴露全部用户凭据并关闭关键服务","Chainalysis 调查针对其系统的持续 Agentic 网络攻击时发现，全部用户的姓名、用户名、密码哈希和有效令牌均被暴露，公司因此关闭 KYT 用户界面、API、地址筛查产品及登录页并锁定受影响账户。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/chainalysis-breach-exposes-all-users.html","2026-11-06T08:04:49.000Z","rhcx8rds9x59fqi7rszz9fkz3","奇安信披露多款国产小型软件更新供应链投毒，定向云南省","奇安信威胁情报中心红雨滴团队披露针对国产小型软件更新渠道的供应链投毒行动，已观察到六个国产软件的更新渠道被劫持，涵盖加速器、财务软件、鼠标连点器、电商浏览器，并发现木马化的某即时通讯客户端和被篡改的某系统管理工具。","奇安信威胁情报中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521280&idx=1&sn=98bc4049fa5f0723d874dd6f1089b196","2026-11-06T02:53:00.000Z","br1u99o6q1e93alvm3z1l3hl8","奇安信XLab披露寄生于Control Web Panel的cwpdoor零检出被动后门","奇安信XLab披露 cwpdoor 是攻击者修改 cwpsrv 源码并重新编译形成的被动后门，可通过特定 HTTP/HTTPS 请求头远程执行命令并抑制日志。","奇安信XLab","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzkxMDYzODQxNA==&mid=2247484918&idx=1&sn=a7b4f6f3d1764874de70e497023d4e0e","2026-11-05T07:33:00.000Z","oo2yl4ebtd0m7hsffm7bci8np","Microsoft 披露攻击者利用 ARTEX 批量搜寻 GitHub 密钥并入侵 Azure","Microsoft 观察到攻击者使用 ARTEX 等 Agentic AI 框架批量查询 GitHub 公开仓库，寻找应用凭据、AI 推理 API 密钥等敏感信息，并自动分析结果发动后续攻击。","Microsoft Security Blog","https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/security/blog/2026/11/05/threat-actors-use-agentic-ai-tooling-to-find-and-abuse-exposed-secrets/","2026-11-05T23:46:50.000Z","nukg9pzziesh0qo3zavylwrii","深信服披露针对国内第三方支付机构的定向攻击工具包","深信服深瞻情报实验室发现一套针对某国内第三方支付机构生产环境的定向攻击工具包，共91个文件，涵盖冰蝎与蚁剑内存马、JVM无文件注入、反向隧道、Meterpreter载荷和数据窃取脚本。","深信服千里目安全实验室","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg2NjgzNjA5NQ==&mid=2247526358&idx=2&sn=ec2dc65ec3b9c03bfb8689c7ce09e59c","2026-11-05T09:53:00.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[288,289,290],{"_126":90,"_42":61,"_129":304,"_131":305,"_133":306,"_135":307,"_137":-5,"_141":144,"_143":144,"_174":35},{"_126":299,"_42":300,"_129":301,"_131":169,"_133":302,"_135":303,"_137":172,"_139":173,"_141":142,"_143":144},{"_126":291,"_42":292,"_129":293,"_131":294,"_133":295,"_135":296,"_137":297,"_139":298,"_141":144,"_143":144},"g3kybtog970w0ggudmqpekqgz","LXD DevLXD 跨客体卷劫持漏洞分析","LXD 的 DevLXD 实例设备更新路径缺少自定义存储卷所有权校验，启用 `security.devlxd.management.volumes` 的共享项目内，攻击者可将其他客体的卷挂载到自身容器并读写其内容。","GitHub 安全公告","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-hhf9-qw4v-72xp","2026-11-05T17:40:59.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f426f4f60d806c23.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp 96w","yfynxgt4s7w5imgek8q7a3gou","OpenSSH CVE-2026-123158 在披露数小时后遭到在野利用","OpenSSH 漏洞 CVE-2026-123158 已被在野利用，Previdian 在漏洞公开不到 9 小时后观察到攻击，并确认其蜜罐上的真实 Alpine Linux 系统被取得 root 权限；目前共记录 8 次尝试，均来自日本地址 89.116.89[.]18。","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/06/openssh-sshole-cve-2026-123158-exploitation/","2026-11-06T12:49:41.000Z","OpenSSH/musl 密码认证绕过漏洞 QVD-2026-104595 已由奇安信 CERT 复现，CVSS 3.1 分数 9.8，评级为高危，影响量为千万级。","奇安信 CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247508041&idx=1&sn=298ed9e842bc1bb98241c38a3c69b57d","2026-11-06T01:31:00.000Z",{"_126":280,"_42":281,"_129":282,"_131":283,"_133":284,"_135":285,"_137":-5,"_141":144,"_143":144},{"_126":274,"_42":275,"_129":276,"_131":277,"_133":278,"_135":279,"_137":-5,"_141":142,"_143":144},{"_126":299,"_42":300,"_129":301,"_131":169,"_133":302,"_135":303,"_137":172,"_139":173,"_141":142,"_143":144},"leadParagraph",{"_313":314,"_315":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
